    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Greeting: Be it known that, —\nRobert C. Ogilvie\nWas Awarded this\nTWA Jet Flight\ncertificate, having flown\nFrom _\nOn the\nSan Francisco\n- To\n22nd\nday of.\nCharles S. Thomas C.s. Jh\nNew York\nApril, 1959\nPresident, TRANS WORLD AIRLINES\nomas",
      "TRANS WORLD AIRLINES, INc.\n380 Madison Avenue\nNew York 17, New York. US. A.\nCongratulations!\n--And Here Is Your\nJet Flight Certificate\nIn years to come I am sure you will look back with pride\non your \"pioneer\" jet flight. It was a pleasure to have\nyou aboard the IWA Boeing 707, and it is a pleasure to\nsend you this certificate commemorating your flight.\nI think you will find the certificate an attractive addition\nto your \"trophy\" collection, ideally suited for framing and\ndisplay on your home or office wall.\nIWA plans call for continued leadership in the Jet Age now\nupon us. I hope we shall have the opportunity to welcome\nyou aboard many more flights as IWA jet service is initiated\non more and more of our domestic and overseas routes.\nSincerely,\ne. 3. Thomas\nC. S. Thomas\nPresident\nCST/MH\nencl.",
      "30\nUNITED\nSTATES\nPOSTAGE\nUNITED\nSTATES\n6 CENTS\n6 CENTS 6\n9\n59\n1959\nTWAR\nFIRST\nCLASS\nMAIL\nFROM\nTRANS WORLD AIRLINES\n380 Madison Avenue\nNew York 17, N. Y.\nFOR:\nMr • Robert C. Ogilvie\n571 Craig Road\nBurlingame, Calif.\nPrinted in U. S. A.\nRANS WORLD AIRLINES"
    ],
